OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA bright
OL,6,Fevening with any showers dying out. A
OL,7,Fdry start to the night but thicker
OL,8,Fcloud and patchy rain will spread
OL,9,Feastwards later perhaps east Fife
OL,10,Fstaying dry.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA mostly cloudy day with
OL,13,Foutbreaks of rain. Best chance of dry
OL,14,Fand bright spells will be in the east.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA dry
OL,17,Fstart to Monday then rain spreading
OL,18,Feastwards. Mainly dry on Tuesday then
OL,19,Fbright spells and showers on Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
